"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[99745],{99745:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<RestaurantCard\\n  cover=\\"/assets/snippets/location/d1dc0cb33a749e370598d3274be2fc2e.jpg\\"\\n  title=\\"Sinchang Gukbap Main Branch\\"\\n  cuisine=\\"Korean\\"\\n  address=\\"53 Bosu-daero, Seo-gu, Busan\\"\\n  rating=4\\n  tags=\\"restaurant\\"\\n/>\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nI visited the main branch of Sinchang Gukbap, one of the famous pork rice soup restaurants in Busan.  \\nI went to check it out after it was introduced on `Michin Matjib` (Crazy Good Restaurants).  \\n\\nSince I visited during a late lunch hour on a weekday, luckily I could enter immediately without a wait.  \\n\\nPerhaps because we looked like tourists from out of town, they guided us to a seat where famous people had sat.  \\nActually, those things aren\'t very important to us, but since there were plenty of seats anyway, we sat in a spot where a celebrity had been.  \\n\\nCute enough, each chair had the name of who sat there.  \\nI sat in the seat where Chairman Lee Jae-yong had sat.  \\n\\nThere were many celebrities\' signatures on the walls.  \\n\\nThe `pork rice soup` I ordered came out quickly.  \\nI ordered the standard toryeom (rinsed with hot broth) pork rice soup and `ttaro-gukbap` (rice and soup served separately), but since I eat everything well and have an unrefined palate, I didn\'t feel a big difference.  \\nBoth were delicious.  \\n\\nIt was a clear, light style without being greasy.  \\n\\nIt\'s a style that might be polarizing, but I liked it.  \\n## Pictures\\n<pictures>\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/91e3026c921c04cecbab277a3b3d119b.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Sinchang Gukbap Main Branch\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/3cb7f308748c2238223fc51f45420025.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Sinchang Gukbap Main Branch\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/9b1ef52293f5b418a2b7a86ede1a8419.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Sinchang Gukbap Main Branch\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/fc533ec6373871a78f60e442ec7fa041.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Sinchang Gukbap Main Branch\\">\\n</pictures>\\n"}')}}]);